=== First Time ===
{| class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed wikitable centertext"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|- class="article-row-main"
|Interaction 1
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Hey!}}
|-
|Interaction 2
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I'm the guy that never stops talking}}
|-
|Interaction 3
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: All I do is say stuff}}
|-
|Interaction 4
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I'm not entirely sure why but I can't help it}}
|-
|Interaction 5
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: There really is no point talking to me}}
|-
|Interaction 6
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I won't give you anything}}
|-
|Interaction 7
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I won't even say anything interesting}}
|-
|Interaction 8
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I just talk about random things}}
|-
|Interaction 9
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Like for example}}
|-
|Interaction 10
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: The other day I met some kind of wizard}}
|-
|Interaction 11
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: And they told me to come back in 3 to 5 business days}}
|-
|Interaction 12
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: That was over a year ago}}
|-
|Interaction 13
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Still nothing}}
|-
|Interaction 14
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: What kind of people do that?}}
|-
|Interaction 15
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Tells you to come back in a few days for no reason}}
|-
|Interaction 16
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Really makes you think}}
|-
|Interaction 17
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Also this guy, Crappox or something}}
|-
|Interaction 18
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Told me to kill enemy monsters for him}}
|-
|Interaction 19
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I asked him how much he'd pay me}}
|-
|Interaction 20
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: He said I had to pay him instead}}
|-
|Interaction 21
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Makes no sense to me}}
|-
|Interaction 22
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I met a guy called Jerry too}}
|-
|Interaction 23
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Smart guy, he's going places}}
|-
|Interaction 24
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Met him a few times in fact, he's always around}}
|-
|Interaction 25
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Not the best for conversations but}}
|-
|Interaction 26
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: At least he's a good listener}}
|-
|Interaction 27
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: And I like that, good listeners}}
|-
|Interaction 28
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But you know what I don't like listening to?}}
|-
|Interaction 29
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: People who play that harp}}
|-
|Interaction 30
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: You know the one I'm talking about?}}
|-
|Interaction 31
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Always people playing it, but terrible music}}
|-
|Interaction 32
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Sometimes they even stop in the middle of the song}}
|-
|Interaction 33
|style="text-align: left;"|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: And they restart, just like that}}
|-
|Interaction 34
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Go figures}}
|-
|Interaction 35
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: There's also this guy who's asking me to race him sometimes}}
|-
|Interaction 36
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: He's acting like he's the best}}
|-
|Interaction 37
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But I always beat him first try}}
|-
|Interaction 38
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: What's his problem?}}
|-
|Interaction 39
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: At least he's an original}}
|-
|Interaction 40
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Most people always talk about coins around here}}
|-
|Interaction 41
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Everything has a value, and time is money}}
|-
|Interaction 42
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: People don't take their time to enjoy the little things}}
|-
|Interaction 43
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Even you I'm sure}}
|-
|Interaction 44
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: You really think I'm going to reward you with something}}
|-
|Interaction 45
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But I'm not, I swear}}
|-
|Interaction 46
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: You can leave at any time and it won't affect anything}}
|-
|Interaction 47
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I just like to talk, I can go on for hours}}
|-
|Interaction 48
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Someone told me I was interesting once}}
|-
|Interaction 49
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Didn't believe them one bit}}
|-
|Interaction 50
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: So many people lying and trying to be your friend}}
|-
|Interaction 51
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: They all have a motive}}
|-
|Interaction 52
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Especially those mayor candidates}}
|-
|Interaction 53
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: All they want is your vote}}
|-
|Interaction 54
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But do they really care about me?}}
|-
|Interaction 55
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Doubt [x]}}
|-
|Interaction 56
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: It's always so black and white with them}}
|-
|Interaction 57
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Mining, fishing, they never mix}}
|-
|Interaction 58
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Why is that? What if I like mining and fishing?}}
|-
|Interaction 59
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But there is no point arguing}}
|-
|Interaction 60
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: They are always right}}
|-
|Interaction 61
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: And the people, sheep I say}}
|-
|Interaction 62
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: They always vote for the same}}
|-
|Interaction 63
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: It's always a landslide}}
|-
|Interaction 64
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Everyone wants to do like everyone else}}
|-
|Interaction 65
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Not me, I'm a free spirit}}
|-
|Interaction 66
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I'll tell you why}}
|-
|Interaction 67
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: My home is clean and beautiful}}
|-
|Interaction 68
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Is your island beautiful?}}
|-
|Interaction 69
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: A proper island is the key to success}}
|-
|Interaction 70
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Healthy island leads to healthy life}}
|-
|Interaction 71
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Also, remember those island we could place?}}
|-
|Interaction 72
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Like the sand one and forest one?}}
|-
|Interaction 73
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: What happened to those, why not more?}}
|-
|Interaction 74
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: So weird, it looked promising}}
|-
|Interaction 75
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Instead you have me}}
|-
|Interaction 76
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Sometimes I wonder}}
|-
|Interaction 77
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: If I wasn't talking, what would people do instead}}
|-
|Interaction 78
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Am I a waste of time and space}}
|-
|Interaction 79
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Is that why I'm here, on this world}}
|-
|Interaction 80
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Maybe it's time I do something with my life}}
|-
|Interaction 81
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I could run for mayor}}
|-
|Interaction 82
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I wonder if people would vote for me}}
|-
|Interaction 83
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: What would my program even be?}}
|-
|Interaction 84
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I would reward people for talking}}
|-
|Interaction 85
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But not those who talk about their auctions, yuck}}
|-
|Interaction 86
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I would reward people who explore and walk around}}
|-
|Interaction 87
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I would fill the village with friends with amazing stories to tell}}
|-
|Interaction 88
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But who would vote for me}}
|-
|Interaction 89
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Maybe instead I should stay there and keep talking}}
|-
|Interaction 90
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Talking is my favorite event}}
|-
|Interaction 91
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I like events but I prefer uneventful days}}
|-
|Interaction 92
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: That way I can keep talking}}
|-
|Interaction 93
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I can't believe you are still listening}}
|-
|Interaction 94
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: You are one of a kind}}
|-
|Interaction 95
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I have many more stories up my sleeve}}
|-
|Interaction 96
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Like that time I found a fairy soul}}
|-
|Interaction 97
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I went to Tia after because she asked me to}}
|-
|Interaction 98
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: So I asked her, what are fairy souls?}}
|-
|Interaction 99
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: And she said they are the remains of dead fairies}}
|-
|Interaction 100
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Isn't that terrible?! So many dead fairies everywhere!}}
|-
|Interaction 101
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: She also said that all those fairies didn't die a peaceful death.}}
|-
|Interaction 102
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: They were all killed! A long time ago.}}
|-
|Interaction 103
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But why would anyone do that? And who did it?}}
|-
|Interaction 104
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: The strangest part is, Tia really didn't seem phased about it.}}
|-
|Interaction 105
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Just thinking about it I have a chill down my spine.}}
|-
|Interaction 106
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Those fairies are so strange.}}
|-
|Interaction 107
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But you know what else is strange?}}
|-
|Interaction 108
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Accessories, I mean what are those}}
|-
|Interaction 109
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I have an entire bag full of accessories}}
|-
|Interaction 110
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I'm basically a garage sale at this point}}
|-
|Interaction 111
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: My favorite one is the cat one}}
|-
|Interaction 112
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I love cats}}
|-
|Interaction 113
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I want a cat pet but not the black one, bad memories}}
|-
|Interaction 114
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Cats are the best, they listen to me}}
|-
|Interaction 115
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I think they are learning, one day they will take control}}
|-
|Interaction 116
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But be my guest, a cat mayor is all I need}}
|-
|Interaction 117
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: My second favorite activity is sleeping}}
|-
|Interaction 118
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But even in my sleep, I dream of talking}}
|-
|Interaction 119
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Sometimes I dream that I'm talking to myself}}
|-
|Interaction 120
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: A whole table with 10 clones of me around it}}
|-
|Interaction 121
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: All of us pretending to be more interesting than the others}}
|-
|Interaction 122
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But how could we? We are all the same}}
|-
|Interaction 123
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I guess my dreams are not very creative}}
|-
|Interaction 124
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I don't have a great imagination, that's why I never lie}}
|-
|Interaction 125
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I wonder though, do you think there will be another world like this one day?}}
|-
|Interaction 126
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Somewhere else, not exactly the same, but better in some way}}
|-
|Interaction 127
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Also it sounds crazy but, do you think we could exist without cubes?}}
|-
|Interaction 128
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Ender Pearls are my favorite items}}
|-
|Interaction 129
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Not because of what they do, but because they are circles}}
|-
|Interaction 130
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I wish the world was a circle too, it's so much prettier}}
|-
|Interaction 131
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I'd love to be in a circle world}}
|-
|Interaction 132
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Maybe there is a circle world somewhere, with someone just like me}}
|-
|Interaction 133
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: In their circle world, dreaming of a cubic world}}
|-
|Interaction 134
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: You really are a great listener}}
|-
|Interaction 135
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Now I regret saying I wouldn't reward you}}
|-
|Interaction 136
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But I swore, and I am a man of my words}}
|-
|Interaction 137
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But thank you for listening, I appreciate it a lot}}
|-
|Interaction 138
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I hope that you are happy and that everything is good in your life}}
|-
|Interaction 139
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: There are ups and down sometimes but there is always a shinning light}}
|-
|Interaction 140
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: My shinning light is you, a beam of hope in this dark cave}}
|-
|Interaction 141
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I'll tell you the story of my life}}
|-
|Interaction 142
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Once upon a time, on an island far away}}
|-
|Interaction 143
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I used to live in a small town, we had a house, 2 floors and an attic}}
|-
|Interaction 144
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Back then I was quite shy and reserved}}
|-
|Interaction 145
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I liked reading and listening to birds}}
|-
|Interaction 146
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: There was always a cat around the house, sometimes killing the birds}}
|-
|Interaction 147
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I hated that cat with a passion, but my parents seemed to enjoy its presence}}
|-
|Interaction 148
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: One day the cat gave birth to 3 little devils, and decided to hide them in our attic}}
|-
|Interaction 149
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: They were making so much noise, right above my room}}
|-
|Interaction 150
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I never understood the reason we had to leave them be, I wanted them out}}
|-
|Interaction 151
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: One day after sundown, a fire started spreading in our house}}
|-
|Interaction 152
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Quickly we understood it was too late to stop it, and exited the house with our valuables}}
|-
|Interaction 153
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I was asked if I knew whether or not the kittens were still inside the house}}
|-
|Interaction 154
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: When asked that question, I remained silent, but I knew the answer}}
|-
|Interaction 155
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Soon after, the flames were engulfing the house}}
|-
|Interaction 156
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Suddenly the mom cat appeared from the shadows of the night and ran into the house}}
|-
|Interaction 157
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: This creature usually so afraid of the fire, rushed into the infernal flames}}
|-
|Interaction 158
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: About 20 seconds later, the cat passed the front door again, holding one of their cubs}}
|-
|Interaction 159
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: And immediately after, dashed back inside the fire to save the rest of their litter}}
|-
|Interaction 160
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: After the second trip, the cat was burning, but still went back in, right after making sure the cub was safe}}
|-
|Interaction 161
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I waited 30 seconds, my eyes fixed on the front door, holding my breath}}
|-
|Interaction 162
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Finally it came out with the last kitten}}
|-
|Interaction 163
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: The cat was in terrible shape, but the kittens were safe}}
|-
|Interaction 164
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: It looked one last time at them, and died next to the 3 little bodies}}
|-
|Interaction 165
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I was in shambles, never in my life had I been so wrong}}
|-
|Interaction 166
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Later on I buried the cat under my favorite tree, and adopted their cubs}}
|-
|Interaction 167
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I loved those 3 little devils with all my heart and gave them all the care in the world}}
|-
|Interaction 168
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: They became beautiful and happy cats, their mom would have been proud}}
|-
|Interaction 169
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: This event changed me to my very core, everything about me had to change}}
|-
|Interaction 170
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: From that day I never hated anything anymore, and never stopped talking}}
|-
|Interaction 171
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: But having said this story, I'll exceptionally need to take a break}}
|-
|Interaction 172
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: I haven't told that story to many people}}
|-
|Interaction 173
| style="text-align: left;" |{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Tal Ker&f: Thank you for listening to me}}
|}
<br>
=== Completed First Dialogue ===
